<title>USA: Aracruz in joint venture firm.</title>
<headline>Aracruz in joint venture firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aracruz Celulose SA said Monday it will join with Gutchess International Group of Cortland, N.Y., to create a new firm, Tecflor Industrial SA.</p>
<p>Tecflor will enter the area of solid wood product production, which will be a new enterprise for Aracruz.</p>
<p>Aracruz said it will link its plantation base and forest technology to the production and distribution expertise of Gutchess, a forest products manufacturer.</p>
</text>
